### Third-Party Data & Asset Attributions

1. **Geographic Boundaries (`public/maps/footprint-ne-v1.json`)**:
   Derived from Natural Earth (Public Domain). https://www.naturalearthdata.com/
2. **Earth Day Terrain (`public/maps/earth/earth-day.webp`)**:
   NASA Earth Observatory, Blue Marble Next Generation (January 2004, Base Topography).
   https://science.nasa.gov/earth/earth-observatory/blue-marble-next-generation/base-topography/
3. **Earth Night Lights (`public/maps/earth/earth-night.webp`)**:
   NASA Earth Observatory, Black Marble 2016 (VIIRS Suomi NPP).
   https://science.nasa.gov/earth/earth-observatory/earth-at-night/maps/
4. **D3.js (`public/maps/d3-7.9.0.min.js`)**:
   Copyright 2010-2023 Mike Bostock. Released under the ISC License.
